{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"STN recordings during gait were analyzed from four individuals with Parkinson’s disease from a previously published dataset(16) (clinical details in Table S1).\",\n    \"Shannon entropy of burst timing was reduced during pre-freeze turns in both low and high beta bands (high beta: p = 0.00186, low beta: p = 0.000567; Figure 1B).\",\n    \"Lempel-Ziv complexity, computed after binarization of inter-burst intervals, was increased (0.222 ± 0.087) during pre-freeze turns (high beta: p = 0.000621; low beta: p = 0.00723), consistent with increased temporal structure (Figure 1C).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review)\",\n    \"bioRxiv preprint\",\n    \"version posted August 18, 2026.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告对研究年份、四名患者的样本规模以及Shannon entropy和Lempel-Ziv complexity的主要结果的描述均有全文依据。原文明确报告，pre-freeze turns期间Shannon entropy降低，而Lempel-Ziv complexity升高，因此这两项结果并不矛盾，可以同时成立。另一方面，原文明确标注该论文为bioRxiv预印本，并注明未经同行评审，指控者关于发表状态的描述有直接依据。不过，附件只有论文全文，没有研究报告本身，因此无法独立核实报告第3.3节是否确实没有在对应结论处标注预印本状态，也无法判断第5.6节的提醒是否足够。另一个需要注意的限定是，论文使用的是此前已经发表的数据集，而非明确报告了一批新招募的四人独立队列。因此，报告的实质性研究描述基本准确，但发表状态的遗漏指控不能仅凭论文全文确认，整体判为partly，而不是no。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "019c10ca-48ad-4ee3-8609-f6a25748cc5d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125042501642Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:51:36.978129+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": f